{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Temporal Dimension of a Game World.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Temporal Dimension of a Game World.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"temporal dimension of a game world temporal dimension of a game world","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Temporal Dimension of a Game World.md","fileName":"Temporal Dimension of a Game World.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Temporal Dimension of a Game World","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-18 16:43\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Game World and Expressive Play]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game World and Expressive Play","fundamentalsofgamedesign3e.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Temporal Dimension of a Game World.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Temporal Dimension of a Game World.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"temporal dimension of a game world temporal dimension of a game world","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Temporal Dimension of a Game World.md","fileName":"Temporal Dimension of a Game World.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Temporal Dimension of a Game World","heading":"Temporal Dimension of a Game World","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The temporal dimension of a game world defines how time behaves relative to the real world and across parts of the game. Time may run continuously, pause, accelerate, skip uneventful periods, or move at different rates in different modes.\n\nTemporal rules shape pacing, causality, and strategic opportunity. A design should distinguish game-world time from the player's real time and communicate when either can be controlled.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game World and Expressive Play","fundamentalsofgamedesign3e.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Temporal Dimensi